rannuation Fund Authority website. Its purpose is to provide information about the Authority and the Government Superannuation Fund.</p><p>The Government Superannuation Fund Authority is an autonomous Crown Entity, established in October 2001. Its functions are to manage and administer the Government Superannuation Fund (<strong>GSF</strong> or the <strong>Fund</strong>) and the GSF Schemes in accordance with the<a href=\"https://www.legislation.govt.nz/act/public/1956/0047/latest/whole.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Government Superannuation Fund Act 1956 </a>and subsequent amendments (the <strong>GSF Act</strong>).</p><p>All decisions relating to the business of the Authority are made by the Authority Board.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong></strong><br /></p><h2></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n      <div class=\"bodycopy\">\r\n        <h4>Quick Links </h4>\r\n\r\n        <ul class=\"list-unstyled\"><li><a href=\"/publications/annual-report/\">Annual Report</a></li><li><a href=\"/members/forms-and-booklets/\">Scheme Booklets</a></li><li><a href=\"/about-us/contact-us/\">Contact Us</a></li><li><a href=\"/members/administrator/\">Contact Administrator, Datacom</a></li><li><a href=\"/members/bereavement/\">Bereavement</a></li></ul>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        \r\n      \r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n      <footer>\r\n        <ul class=\"links\">\r\n          <li class=\"hidden-print\"><a href=\"/policies/terms-conditions/\">Terms and Conditions</a></li>\r\n          <li class=\"hidden-print\"><a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy/\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\r\n          <li class=\"hidden-print\"><a href=\"/about-us/contact-us/\">Contact Us</a></li>\r\n          <li>Last Updated: 25 Nov 2025</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n        <div class=\"copy\">\r\n          <p>&copy; 2026 Government Superannuation Fund Authority</p>\r\n          <a href=\"http://www.govt.nz/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hidden-print\" style=\"text-al